# State

- Use `BlockbusterDataProvider` for index JSON and region aggregates
- Local `useState` for UI selection/chat is fine
- No Redux/Zustand/MobX without governance approval
- Keep context value identity stable (`useMemo` / `useCallback` as established)
- See `docs/STATE_MANAGEMENT.md`
